    the self-feeding bowl clamp is a manufactured article,
        confer "“Dymmoy Self-Feeding Bowl Clamp.” It is a reusable and washable feeding accessory designed for babies and toddlers that are six months of age and older".
    the self-feeding bowl clamp is made of plastics,
        confer "acrylonitrile butadiene styrene (ABS) plastic along with internal metal components which support the internal".
    the principal use of the self-feeding bowl clamp is securing a feeding bowl,
        according to CBP, confer "This article is used to secure a separate feeding bowl to a dining table or highchair tray during".
