% NY N340223 (May 2024): a plastic mat from China.
scenario ny_n340223 is, as stated in ruling NY N340223:
    the kitchen rug M516 is a manufactured article,
        confer "The article is a rectangular beige mat with three layers that measure approximately 20 inches wide by 40 inches long".
    the kitchen rug M516 is a composite good,
        confer "This item is considered to be a composite good within the meaning of General Rule of Interpretation (GRI) 3".
    the coated nonwoven layer of the kitchen rug M516 is a component of the kitchen rug M516,
        confer "a rectangular beige mat with three layers that measure approximately 20 inches wide by 40 inches long".
    the rubber foam back of the kitchen rug M516 is a component of the kitchen rug M516,
        confer "The back of the mat is a polyurethane-coated fabric laminated with neoprene foam rubber".
    the coated nonwoven layer of the kitchen rug M516 is made of plastics,
        according to the CBP laboratory, confer "the sample mat comprises a man-made non-woven fabric coated, covered, impregnated, or laminated with poly (ether-ester urethane)".
    the essential character of the kitchen rug M516 is given by the coated nonwoven layer of the kitchen rug M516,
        according to CBP, confer "material provides this item with the essential character within the meaning of GRI 3(b)".
    the principal use of the kitchen rug M516 is household use,
        according to CBP, confer "The mat is designed and marketed for household use".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the kitchen rug M516 is 3924.90"].

