        confer "The merchandise at issue is a plastic bag manufactured in Turkey".
    the reclosable bag is shaped as sack,
        confer "The merchandise at issue is a plastic bag manufactured in Turkey".
    the reclosable bag contains 80 percent of polyethylene,
        confer "The polyethylene comprises 80 percent by weight of the bag".
    the principal use of the reclosable bag is packing of goods,
        according to CBP, confer "has an integral extruded closure at the top and is intended for supplementary packaging".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the reclosable bag is 3923.21"].

